Reproductions of work order S1.3a-r (brief ALE_S1_3A_R), written by test_ale_stepper --dump-on-error.
Each directory: meta, weight, chain_0..chain_7 (3N doubles each; chain_7 the failing target, chain_6 the last
good frame), forced_<r> (the slots forced in round r of the failing frame).

gpu64_1  tg_Z64_F --motion follow --tend 1, GPU, step 129, Fh: one-sided facet after 2 rounds (cap 2).
         log ../S1_3a_r.catch64_1.tg_Z64_F.gpu.log. Reproduces on the HOST from the dump with cap 2:
           OMP_NUM_THREADS=8 build_s2/tests/kokkos/test_ale_frame --replay build_s2/gate_logs/S1_3a_r.repro/gpu64_1
         (cap 2: target_empty_or_one_sided=2/2, ../S1_3a_r.replay.gpu64_1.host.log; cap 8: rounds=3, clean,
         ../S1_3a_r.replay_cure.gpu64_1.host.log).
gpu64_2  tg_Z64_F --motion follow --tend 1, GPU, step 58, Fh: open cell 210569 (disagreement 1.037e-13 of its
         surface, bar 1e-13; worst facet toward 210570). Reproduces on the GPU, 3/3, and the GPU cold build of the
         target is open alike (host cold build: 6.74e-14, closed):
           OMP_NUM_THREADS=8 build_s2_cuda/tests/kokkos/test_ale_frame --replay build_s2/gate_logs/S1_3a_r.repro/gpu64_2 --cell 210569
